    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421940/extras/63e0d64bc2422e2bd45ba3ac15e5a4b5.avif?t=1742046587\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude38 A portion of the profit from this game will be allocated to street cat rescue and support initiatives. \ud83d\ude3b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Showdown:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Baspetball</i> is a basketball-themed puzzle game with strategic elements, where the player controls a team of cats, each with their own unique abilities and movement styles. The goal is to plan their actions carefully to score baskets without letting the opposing team of dogs steal the ball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e 50 handcrafted levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\ud83c\udfb5\u200b Original soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f 5 different scenarios. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 Cute cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc15 Cute dogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc0 Characters with basketball legend numbers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Game experience designed for both think and relax.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421940/extras/63e0d64bc2422e2bd45ba3ac15e5a4b5.avif?t=1742046587\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude38 A portion of the profit from this game will be allocated to street cat rescue and support initiatives. \ud83d\ude3b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Showdown:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Baspetball</i> is a basketball-themed puzzle game with strategic elements, where the player controls a team of cats, each with their own unique abilities and movement styles. The goal is to plan their actions carefully to score baskets without letting the opposing team of dogs steal the ball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e 50 handcrafted levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\ud83c\udfb5\u200b Original soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f 5 different scenarios. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 Cute cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc15 Cute dogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc0 Characters with basketball legend numbers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Game experience designed for both think and relax.</p>",
    "short_description": "When the tutors leave, the house turns into a basketball court, and the ultimate showdown begins: Cats vs. Dogs. Take control of basketball-playing cats, move, pass, and shoot a yarn ball to score baskets while outsmarting dog opponents. Explore creative strategies and make that swish!",
